 a NEW level via active probing on >=1 clean L1 game, offline-reproduced, with
 the NO-PROBE (passive) ablation FAILING. arXiv:2506.01876 + 2309.08477.
 live_path-reachable. live_agent_self_discovery. verifier_is_oracle:false.
 retire_if_same_verdict.

